WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.110
Every song you love.

00:00:01.386 --> 00:00:03.936
Offline, free, and no PC needed.

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:08.334
Search any song, listen first,
then save it to a playlist.

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:10.400
It downloads right on your phone.

00:00:11.671 --> 00:00:15.961
Your playlists, with big covers, in a
calm Minimal look or the classic Crimson.

00:00:17.404 --> 00:00:18.994
The player breathes with your music.

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:23.150
A soft wave rides the progress line,
and live lyrics follow along.

00:00:24.404 --> 00:00:25.234
Start a Jam.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:28.510
Make one phone the speaker,
or play every phone in sync.

00:00:29.838 --> 00:00:30.988
Here's the good part.

00:00:31.239 --> 00:00:33.429
Friends anywhere join with your Jam code.

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:36.540
You let them in,
and everyone hears the same moment.

00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:41.054
Send songs to a friend nearby,
over Wi-Fi or Bluetooth.

00:00:42.504 --> 00:00:46.234
In the car, you get big buttons,
and your playlists on Android Auto.

00:00:47.438 --> 00:00:48.448
Got a huge playlist?

00:00:48.894 --> 00:00:52.344
The Windows app saves it in one go,
then sends it to your phone.

00:00:53.604 --> 00:00:54.474
SpotVault.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.020
Free for Android, iPhone and Windows.

